ncy and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aFeHrkoPV7YQ7kNvwGz1A8j&_nc_oc=Ado-0xtSdQMrCwiM1aT3pY0nW13vpV33fE_8Z7t_vU7P1yQfSAVovS8Wwukmj2KJLIc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLIs-uy0pPUOo8UGcKjU45_315ZKQHmvGOuhRaURFKT6w&oe=6AA55439"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nKgbVdPfaPwQ7kNvwFswUy1&_nc_oc=Adol97_8ta9NKUoQ04uwARikS1o2AiEf6PsVhXbR_vUIunjyo0Hj6UDioI4JokXyam4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLvfDodrNSYAxJjLWdHAz8Td3XlfzmErpzzK6nj3LPfQQ&oe=6AA5428F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wxxPZEamsosQ7kNvwGfV_P9&_nc_oc=AdpWKs-qgupHdb6fmeWZpIuZ7a7dFeTn9amOoXGecdQk4WuU86oFOWpOtrbkDBeXwNc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJYfwZ3cDRwIQjAyj11ygyWAd-HmvodfE4dbY88cU9yhA&oe=6AA5506E"}, {"file_name": "005.VS_M_Squar